(R/'report-contract.json').write_text(json.dumps({'all_evidence_paths_nonempty':True,'eight_checks':True,'variation_schema':load('evidence-contract.json'),'findings':len(report['findings']),'verdict':report['verdict']},indent=2)+'\n')
(R/'session-state.md').write_text('Review complete: revise. Saved final structured report review.json. Demonstrated defects: canonical e-3634 x cos x excluded by n=2..4; base4 valid ln4=2ln2 equivalent unresolved in native grader in both TeX/plain notation. Independent math143+runner5 passed; 11 bank replays/102 source fragments passed; source canonical coverage failed. Native178cases:349 accepted,575 rejected,2 unexpected unresolved. UI27+1 visually inspected. Delivery143->114,runner5->5,counterfactual17->16. Conditional learner selection scenarios documented, active policy/history unavailable. Variation schema and all sample/evidence paths validated. Package100files unchanged; no publication/database writes. See commands.md for reproducible commands and harness corrections.\n')
print(json.dumps({'verdict':report['verdict'],'findings':len(report['findings']),'checks':{k:v['status'] for k,v in report['checks'].items()},'all_evidence_paths_nonempty':not missing}))
